> Tomorrow means hope.

Another beautiful flick by Satoshi Kon. The most raw and emotional take on love that movies can offer. Often we find ourselves in love with the journey and how much they impact our lives, not necessarily the person themselves. Ironically, the film parallels itself with Genya taking the role of Chiyoko in the story.

Stunning visuals, beautifully edited to create a chaotic atmosphere at times and an incredible soundtrack as well. Simply amazing once again.

> After all, it's the chasing him that I really love.
